{"id":"d995f8111ca2cd42","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-modal-substitution-semantics.md","title":"模态代入的赋值变换引理","display":"lem-modal-substitution-semantics — 模态代入的赋值变换引理","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-modal-substitution-semantics","aliases":["72-lem-modal-substitution-semantics"],"display":"lem-modal-substitution-semantics — 模态代入的赋值变换引理","depends_on":["[[72-df-modal-substitution]]","[[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII §2, print477–480/PDF489–492; local semantic induction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-modal-substitution-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-modal-substitution-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-modal-substitution-semantics — 模态代入的赋值变换引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"50496a022b75cf4f\" href=\"?note=50496a022b75cf4f\" title=\"72-df-modal-substitution\">72-df-modal-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91aa38d1fd431425\" href=\"?note=91aa38d1fd431425\" title=\"72-df-modal-kripke-model\">72-df-modal-kripke-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII §2, print477–480/PDF489–492; local semantic induction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq W^2\">\\(R\\subseteq W^2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\)</span>；满足集合取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"91aa38d1fd431425\" href=\"?note=91aa38d1fd431425\" title=\"72-df-modal-kripke-model\">72-df-modal-kripke-model</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\sigma_m,\\operatorname{pv}_m\">\\(\\sigma,\\sigma_m,\\operatorname{pv}_m\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"50496a022b75cf4f\" href=\"?note=50496a022b75cf4f\" title=\"72-df-modal-substitution\">72-df-modal-substitution</a>；不要求R满足GL框架条件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\sigma,\\mathcal M_\\sigma\">\\(V_\\sigma,\\mathcal M_\\sigma\\)</span> 在下式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V&#39;\">\\(V&#39;\\)</span> 是同一框架上的另一个全赋值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_\\sigma(i):=⟦\\sigma(i)⟧_{\\mathcal M},\\qquad\n\\mathcal M_\\sigma:=\\langle W,R,V_\\sigma\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_\\sigma(i):=⟦\\sigma(i)⟧_{\\mathcal M},\\qquad\n\\mathcal M_\\sigma:=\\langle W,R,V_\\sigma\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\sigma_m(A)⟧_{\\mathcal M}=⟦ A⟧_{\\mathcal M_\\sigma}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\sigma_m(A)⟧_{\\mathcal M}=⟦ A⟧_{\\mathcal M_\\sigma}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V\\restriction\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)=V&#39;\\restriction\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ ⟦ A⟧_{\\langle W,R,V\\rangle}=⟦ A⟧_{\\langle W,R,V&#39;\\rangle}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V\\restriction\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)=V&#39;\\restriction\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ ⟦ A⟧_{\\langle W,R,V\\rangle}=⟦ A⟧_{\\langle W,R,V&#39;\\rangle}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>变量分支是新赋值定义，假公式为空集，蕴涵用补和并保持等式。方框分支的后继关系相同，对每个后继使用子公式归纳假设，再由全称条件得到相同集合。第二个局部性结论也按此归纳，证明只依赖A实际出现的有限变量。因此后续有限模型检查可以忽略其余无限多个命题变量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"50496a022b75cf4f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"91aa38d1fd431425","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"91aa38d1fd431425","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W\\ne\\varnothing$、$R\\subseteq W^2$、$V:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W)$，$\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle$；满足集合取 [[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"50496a022b75cf4f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$、$\\sigma,\\sigma_m,\\operatorname{pv}_m$ 取 [[72-df-modal-substitution]]；不要求R满足GL框架条件。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"W\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq W^2","display":false},{"tex":"V:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\sigma_m,\\operatorname{pv}_m","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\sigma,\\mathcal M_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"V'","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\sigma(i):=⟦\\sigma(i)⟧_{\\mathcal M},\\qquad\n\\mathcal M_\\sigma:=\\langle W,R,V_\\sigma\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"⟦\\sigma_m(A)⟧_{\\mathcal M}=⟦ A⟧_{\\mathcal M_\\sigma}.","display":true},{"tex":"V\\restriction\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)=V'\\restriction\\operatorname{pv}_m(A)\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ ⟦ A⟧_{\\langle W,R,V\\rangle}=⟦ A⟧_{\\langle W,R,V'\\rangle}.","display":true}],"bytes":1936,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-444","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-modal-substitution-semantics|lem-modal-substitution-semantics — 模态代入的赋值变换引理]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-437","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-modal-substitution-semantics]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-355","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-modal-substitution-semantics|lem-modal-substitution-semantics — 模态代入的赋值变换引理]]"},{"id":"799dbc6630c443a3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-389","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-lem-modal-substitution-semantics]]"}],"outgoing":["50496a022b75cf4f","91aa38d1fd431425"]}